  "description": "Chayo Mexican Kitchen + Tequila Bar is a lively restaurant in the heart of the Las Vegas Strip, offering a mix of authentic and innovative Mexican cuisine alongside a vast selection of tequila and cocktails. The menu includes classic dishes like tacos, enchiladas, burritos, and fajitas, as well as seafood, vegetarian options, and a kids' menu. With over 100 types of tequila and a variety of cocktails and margaritas, the bar is a highlight. Chayo's atmosphere is energetic and fun, featuring a large patio with Strip views and a mechanical bull for guests to ride.",
